A||||5||CUTTER||should I drive my GT to OC Maryland?||||1||
Z||000000||CUTTER||05-22-2000||12:41 AM||||I live near Lancaster PA and im going to Ocean City Maryland next month and want to take my 87GT with 97000 miles, Im fixing the things that are wrong with it right now so its all ready in 2 1/2 weeks, its around 150-175 miles each way and im hoping nothing will go wrong, I just got it serviced, new tires, alighnment, my fan fixed, next week im getting new bearings, brake pads and getting the "service engine soon" checked out. what could I take with me on my vacation just incase of a breakdown? I will be driving alot during the 5 days i will be down there. I have a little tool set, extra fuses, that im taking with and a flashlight....anything else?<BR>Thanks, Shane||||reg||1
Z||000001||2M4 Dale||05-22-2000||06:49 AM||||Personal phone book...extra cash or emergency credit card... and update your AAA membership||||reg||1
Z||000002||jhogans||05-22-2000||08:12 AM||||I agree with 2M4 Dale.  Especially the AAA Membership||||reg||1
Z||000003||theogre||05-22-2000||09:14 AM||||I'm not doing so much drving this year. last year (10/98-10/99) I did 20,000+ nearly all of it in the delaware valley. my 87 had 116k when I started.<P>I'd make sure the car has a good alarm and a club or fuel cutoff before I left it around any of the shore towns for any length of time.||||reg||1
Z||000004||LarryB||05-22-2000||12:07 PM||||Everything 2M4Dale listed, plus a fully charged cell phone, if you don't have one try to borrow one from a friend or relative. If you break down on the highway or a seedy part of town that and a phonebook are a godsend. ||||reg||1
Z||000005||ChadMan||05-22-2000||01:08 PM||||You might consider taking an extra ignition control module - the small black module in the distributor, held down with two 7mm (?) nuts.  These can fail suddenly and without warning, leaving you stranded - but replacing one takes only about 15 minutes or so.<P>I love taking trips by Fiero - I think the seats are great.  I can cover 800 miles in a day without getting a sore back, legs, etc.||||reg||1
